WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:02,620
Ten people set off

2
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:04,460
Why are you two the only ones back?

3
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,740
We Yan Yue also evacuated and searched in the direction we left.

4
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:08,700
Encountered a very strong one in Xinhu District

5
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:09,620
Strict plainclothes species

6
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:11,260
Team members attack first

7
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:12,620
After the opponent counterattacks

8
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:14,540
Our people quickly lost their life signals

9
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:16,460
Why can you come back alive?

10
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,460
We were standing in the back room of the procession

11
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:19,860
I'll take Du Ling with me.

12
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:20,980
Out of combat range

13
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:23,530
All three statements are true.

14
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:26,530
If you don’t find out the lie, go to treatment first.

15
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:28,530
The task report will be reissued tonight Yes

16
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:43,750
His life signal has been stable so wait a minute.
